{"title":"Career Roadmap · Contracts Associate","role":"Contracts Associate","summary":"A Contracts Associate in the media and entertainment industry specializes in drafting, reviewing, negotiating, managing, and enforcing commercial agreements involving content, talent, production, distribution, licensing, advertising, technology, and intellectual property.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Media & Entertainment Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Contracts Associate in the media and entertainment industry specializes in drafting, reviewing, negotiating, managing, and enforcing commercial agreements involving content, talent, production, distribution, licensing, advertising, technology, and intellectual property."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Contract Law","Media & Entertainment","Intellectual Property","Commercial Negotiation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract drafting"},{"text":"Contract review"},{"text":"Clause negotiation"},{"text":"Rights and obligations analysis"},{"text":"Talent agreements"},{"text":"Production agreements"},{"text":"Licensing agreements"},{"text":"Distribution agreements"},{"text":"OTT agreements"},{"text":"Music agreements"},{"text":"Advertising agreements"},{"text":"Sponsorship contracts"},{"text":"Vendor agreements"},{"text":"Confidentiality agreements"},{"text":"IP assignments and licences"},{"text":"Contract lifecycle management"},{"text":"Contract-risk analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential employers include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film studios"},{"text":"OTT platforms"},{"text":"Production houses"},{"text":"Music labels"},{"text":"Television networks"},{"text":"Advertising agencies"},{"text":"Publishing companies"},{"text":"Gaming compani